  "note": "whisper failed: URLError: <urlopen error Tunnel connection failed: 403 Forbidden>",
  "lines": [
    {
      "text": "Arjun ke paas sirf pachaas hazaar hain, aur ek galat jagah, sab doob jayega!",
      "start": 0.03,
      "end": 4.065,
      "startFrame": 1,
      "endFrame": 122
    },
    {
      "text": "Woh xerox aur photo ki dukaan kholna chahta hai.",
      "start": 4.35,
      "end": 6.5,
      "startFrame": 130,
      "endFrame": 195
    },
    {
      "text": "Smart log dukaan wahan kholte hain, jahan zarurat pehle se khadi hai.",
      "start": 6.81,
      "end": 9.95,
      "startFrame": 204,
      "endFrame": 298
    },
    {
      "text": "Hospital ke bahar dawai, station ke bahar chai, school ke bahar pen.",
      "start": 10.11,
      "end": 13.725,
      "startFrame": 303,
      "endFrame": 412
    },
    {
      "text": "Toh Arjun ki dukaan, kahan chalegi?",
      "start": 13.92,
      "end": 15.645,
      "startFrame": 418,
      "endFrame": 469
    },
    {
      "text": "A, RTO office ke bahar, jahan log form leke line mein khade hain.",
      "start": 16.12,
      "end": 19.275,
      "startFrame": 484,
      "endFrame": 578
    },
    {
      "text": "B, bade mall ke andar, jahan sabse zyada bheed hai.",
      "start": 19.68,
      "end": 22.815,
      "startFrame": 590,
      "endFrame": 684
    },
    {
      "text": "C, purani xerox dukaan ke bagal mein, kyunki customer wahan aate hain.",
      "start": 23.13,
      "end": 26.94,
      "startFrame": 694,
      "endFrame": 808
    },
    {
      "text": "D, apni gali mein, kyunki wahan kiraya zero hai.",
      "start": 26.94,
      "end": 29.79,
      "startFrame": 808,
      "endFrame": 894
    },
    {
      "text": "Comment mein answer likho, answer in the next reel, follow karo @yourhandle!",
      "start": 29.79,
      "end": 33.555,
      "startFrame": 894,
      "endFrame": 1007
    }
  ],
